WEBVTT

00:00:57.784 --> 00:01:00.871
All I could think about
was counting every single calorie,

00:01:00.895 --> 00:01:03.055
and waking up early
before school every day

00:01:03.079 --> 00:01:04.846
so I could run a few miles.

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:07.164
It took me years
to finally release the grip

00:01:07.188 --> 00:01:09.529
that the eating disorder had over my life.

00:01:09.927 --> 00:01:11.085
But when it did,

00:01:11.109 --> 00:01:12.688
it freed up so much brain space

00:01:12.712 --> 00:01:15.339
to think about what I was truly
passionate about.

00:01:15.363 --> 00:01:16.529
For so long,

00:01:16.553 --> 00:01:19.498
the fashion industry has worked hard
to set an ideal of beauty

00:01:19.522 --> 00:01:22.887
that celebrates thin,
young, white, cisgender,

00:01:22.911 --> 00:01:25.994
able-bodied models as the ideal.

00:01:26.617 --> 00:01:28.649
It's impossible not to be bombarded

00:01:28.673 --> 00:01:30.983
with images of models
that have been photoshopped